// FINE, UNIFORM (ungraded) mesh version of side_outlet_case. Same geometry as the
// coarse case; ONLY the cell counts change. simpleGrading (1 1 1) everywhere -> no
// grading (uniform spacing), by request.
//
// Reactor radii: Ri=0.02540 m, Ro=0.03175 m, gap d=0.00635 m.  z: -0.019050..0.019050.
// side_outlet band = 1 axial cell (0.0004233333 m tall).
//
//   NR = radial cells across the gap    -> Dr = 6.35 mm / NR
//   NZ = axial cells in the main block   -> Dz = 37.677 mm / NZ
// Coarse case was NR=15 (Dr=423 um), NZ=89 (Dz=423 um). Bump NR/NZ below to refine.
// (Uniform mesh => the near-outer-wall cell is Dr; the Sc~1e4 concentration film is
//  ~17-45 um, so only NR >~ 300 begins to resolve it -- see the experiment README.)

convertToMeters 1;

